{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>BMI Calculator 結合身體質量指數計算、體重趨勢追蹤與餐單規劃，適合關注體重變化，或希望為自己與家人分開記錄數據的讀者。程式提供 WHO 國際與 WPRO 亞太區兩種 BMI 分類標準，並可為每位成員設定偏好標準。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-207.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>BMI 計算與體重趨勢</h2>\n<p>輸入年齡、性別、身高與體重，即可用公制或英制單位得出 BMI 值與參考體重範圍。程式可建立多個成員檔案，各自保存測量數據與體重趨勢，切換時會記住上次輸入。每日、每週與每月圖表可觀察長期變化，並可按 BMI 類別取得食譜建議與 3 日或 7 日餐單。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-172-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-173-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-174-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-175-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-176-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-177-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：BMI Calculator: Weight &amp; Diet</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/bmi-calculator-weight-diet/id6755757519?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T01:25:55.345643+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":344,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T01:06:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T00:16:17.438071+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T01:19:31.852494+00:00","content_hash":"e6f92e91dcdd8627f3686a790e3bd9980c35d8f912ef10de42cc0516413e890f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}